# Normal account policies, enabled only after a complete checksum-verified seed
# and a non-mutating cutover preview. Keep the copied per-folder UID state.
IMAPAccount quasimorphic
Host witcher.mxrouting.net
Port 993
User alan@quasimorphic.com
PassCmd "@QUASIMORPHIC_PASSWORD@"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore quasimorphic-remote
Account quasimorphic

MaildirStore quasimorphic-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.mail/quasimorphic/
Inbox ~/.mail/quasimorphic/Inbox

Channel quasimorphic
Far :quasimorphic-remote:
Near :quasimorphic-local:
Patterns * !INBOX/*
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
Remove None
SyncState *

Channel quasimorphic-archives
Far :quasimorphic-remote:
Near :quasimorphic-local:
Patterns INBOX/*
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
Remove None
SyncState *

IMAPAccount broad
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User amunozgo@broadinstitute.org
PassCmd "@BROAD_PASSWORD@"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore broad-remote
Account broad

MaildirStore broad-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.mail/broad/
Inbox ~/.mail/broad/Inbox

Channel broad
Far :broad-remote:
Near :broad-local:
Patterns * !"[Gmail]/All Mail"
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
Remove None
SyncState *

MaildirStore broad-archive-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.cache/mirror-mail/broad/
Inbox ~/.cache/mirror-mail/broad/Inbox

Channel broad-all-mail
Far :broad-remote:
Near :broad-archive-local:
Patterns "[Gmail]/All Mail"
Sync Pull
Create Near
Expunge None
Remove None
SyncState *

IMAPAccount purdue
Host outlook.office365.com
Port 993
User amunozgo@purdue.edu
PassCmd "@OAMA@ access amunozgo@purdue.edu"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt
AuthMechs XOAUTH2

IMAPStore purdue-remote
Account purdue

MaildirStore purdue-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.mail/purdue/
Inbox ~/.mail/purdue/Inbox

Channel purdue
Far :purdue-remote:
Near :purdue-local:
Patterns * !"Sent Items" !Calendar !Calendar/* !Contacts !Journal !Notes !Outbox !Tasks
Sync Pull
Create Near
Expunge Near
Remove None
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

# Upload locally sent messages; the rest of the university mailbox is pull-only.
Channel purdue-sent
Far :purdue-remote:
Near :purdue-local:
Patterns "Sent Items"
Sync All
Create Both
Expunge Both
Remove None
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *
